's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"fe95e144a83b64374ee05ba97e99af97","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6b086262b4b83e8dc581149800dbe3ae","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"e42dfa06ed92a8a2065e38f1f35585c2","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"4237c906ac01c1d1284192d96542288b","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"eed29954486702b5d331a6a7032e825a","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"e4dede7efecd03b0c9e467f7df660cc8","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"1e52216726663a2515fd4b23dea9d31a","originalFileName":"281b9ff4-510a-4bec-a355-1088f098f7b1-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"7feece76